  "statement": "I appreciate the emphasis on balancing efficiency with safety and trust. I support the synthesis of allowing moderate increases in processing time to maintain essential safety checks (SAF-01 and SAF-02). However, we must ensure that any optimizations in encryption (TRU-01) and logging (TRU-06) do not compromise the robustness of the audit trail (SAF-03) and thorough error handling (SAF-04). I propose that we clarify that error handling mechanisms should still provide sufficient detail to detect discrepancies effectively while allowing for a streamlined process to support rapid transaction processing.",
